rpp-release-tool (0.0.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Read codename/component/architectures from conf/distributions on every
    run; stop storing them in the app config or showing them in settings.
  * Merge the two home-menu settings entries into a single Settings page.
  * Policy: require_both defaults to true; missing_arch and buildinfo
    warnings are shown on the confirm page. sha256 and allow_replace remain
    blocking.
  * Publish only with y/Enter.
  * Relax checks reprepro does not require: .dsc Priority is a warning,
    .asc signatures are optional, per-arch .buildinfo is a warning only,
    and binary runtime tar.gz bundles are not treated as source files.
  * CI: stop building armhf; build/test/package amd64 and arm64.

 -- Jianyin Li <lixiaotumail@163.com>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:20:57 +0800

